g far away beside a vertical white light. Hold last two seconds on Arin left foreground kneeling, distant tiny Kael right, blue hall restored for the cut to the next wide shot. Visible boulders, then electrical bolts, then orange fire must be DISTINCT sequential attacks visibly originating from Kael and hitting Arin. No slow motion. Sound: rapid rock rush and crushing impacts, two fierce electrical cracks, explosive fire whoosh and shield hit, armor clatter on floor, magical shimmer then dream wind. No voices, dialogue, music, words or blood."
